content-warning-message =
    Content Warning! Gameplay includes; Kidnapping, Abduction, Mind Control, Murder, Giant Spiders, Pixelated Blood and Gore, and Pixelated Nudity.

    Starlight Alfa, Beta, and Epsilon are Medium Roleplay servers, while Delta is Low Roleplay. Please ensure that you have read the server rules and are behaving in a way that is fitting for the Roleplay level of the server you are currently on. Inexperience is not a bad thing, as long as you are trying! We suggest checking the Roleplay Guides in the Guidebook for more advice and tips, or speaking with other players in Discord.

    

